               with SigProfilerExtractor}",
  author    = "Islam, S M Ashiqul and D\'{\i}az-Gay, Marcos and Wu, Yang and
               Barnes, Mark and Vangara, Raviteja and Bergstrom, Erik N and He,
               Yudou and Vella, Mike and Wang, Jingwei and Teague, Jon W and
